      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce this bright and spacious three bedroom semi-detached family home to the market situated in the extremely sought after cul de sac of Clonsilla Park, D15. Clonsilla Park is located in the popular suburb of Blanchardstown and is situated close to a wealth of amenities including schools, shops and recreational facilities. Nearby amenities include Castleknock Golf and Country Club, St. Brigids GAA Club, Castleknock Lawn Tennis Club, Blanchardstown and Roselawn Shopping Centres, and the Phoenix Park which offers many outdoor pursuits. The area is well-serviced by public transport: Dublin Bus provides a regular service for the area; and Castleknock train station is approximately a 5-minute walk away. The M50, which provides access to the national road network, is just a few minutes' drive away. \r\n\r\nAiry and light filled interior living accommodation of c. 116 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway, lounge, fully fitted kitchen with dining area, second reception room, downstairs full bathroom, three double bedrooms and main family bathroom. No 9 also has the added bonus of an extra large sunny rear garden enhanced by a west facing orientation and ample off-street parking to the front. \r\n\r\nThe property is presented in very good condition and is ready to go with no onward chain. Boasting a long list of additional features to include heaps of built in storage, top quality flooring and open plan living downstairs it truly is an opportunity not to be missed: Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange viewing.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n c.116 Sq.m\r\n BER D1\r\n 3 bed/2 bath\r\n Garage to the side\r\n Three spacious bedrooms\r\n Oil fired central heating\r\n Huge potential\r\n Large open plan room to rear\r\n Fully fitted kitchen with dining area\r\n West facing rear garden\r\n Quiet cul de sac\r\n Ample off street parking\r\n Mature & sought after location\r\n Excellent primary and secondary schools in the area\r\n Easy access to M50 motorway\r\n Bus routes and train station to City Centre close by\r\n Walking distance of Castleknock and Blanchardstown Villages\r\n Early viewing highly advised\r\n\r\nDirections: \r\nEircode = D15 RX4P"
      },
      {
